					2, 6, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupta cartilago,</span>”
				<i>to unite</i>, <i>grow together</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 37, 87, § 216</span></i>
			.</div>
